ious and undergoing further tests at Odense University Hospital after clutching his chest with both hands. This incident is a scary scene that had echoes of his cardiac arrest at the European Championship five years ago.\n\nID: 4171421\nCREATED: 2026-06-08\nDOMAIN: ctvnews.ca\nSLUG: eriksen-doing-well-and-expected-to-leave-the-hospital-after-on-field-collapse-denmark-team-says\nTEXT: Christian Eriksen is doing well and expected to leave the hospital after an on-field collapse during a Denmark team game. The incident occurred on June 7, 2026, in Odense, Denmark. Eriksen was taken to the hospital for treatment and is now on track to be discharged soon, according to the Denmark team.\n\n\n',)
